dsl metta

Concept Campus
	def string manager
	def string location
	Concept:{1..*} Building
		def string address
		def integer yearBuilt
		has Sensor
		Concept:{1..*} Floor
			def integer level
			Concept:{1..*} Room
				def integer area
				has Sensor

Concept Sensor as component
	facet Type
		sub Temperature
		sub Humidity
		sub CO2